+### 5 The plain report has no header line
+
+**Context.** Does the plain report print a header line above its rows? Options: (1) no header, rows only (2) a header line `account<TAB>balance`. The run picked (1) and acted on it; the independent agent of `/answer-doubt` picked (2): the two answers disagree (no owner ruling).
+**Decision.** The plain report prints its rows only, with no header line, so that a script can read every line as a row.
